          "text": "Both, in parallel. The hospital insurance desk escalates to the insurer's helpdesk and can re-submit the pre-auth with better clinical documentation, while you simultaneously note the denial reference number. Only the insurer or TPA can overturn a denial — the hospital can only help you appeal it."
